            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### New
- **JetBrains IDEs in Open In.** PhpStorm, IntelliJ IDEA, WebStorm, PyCharm, GoLand, RubyMine, CLion, Rider, RustRover and Android Studio appear in every Open In menu and in Settings > General > Editor when they are installed. A file link clicked in the terminal opens the file in them without jumping to the line.

### Changed
- The small icon buttons in the board header and the task header (copy path, Finder, remote, commit, refresh, interrupt, find, copy last reply, Open In) now share one size, one colour and one hover effect.
]]></description>
